WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.934
-Amid its investigation

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.367
into Donald Trump's
coup attempt,

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:07.200
the House voted to hold two more
of his associates in contempt

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.100
as Trump moved forward
with his plan

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.267
to undermine our elections,
again, heading into 2024.

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:14.334
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:14.334 --> 00:00:18.734
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:21.567
Last night,
the House took yet another step

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.267
in its attempt to hold
the perpetrators

00:00:23.267 --> 00:00:24.801
of Trump's attempted coup
accountable

00:00:24.801 --> 00:00:27.734
by voting to hold
two more Trump aides in contempt

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:29.434
and referring them
to the Justice Department

00:00:29.434 --> 00:00:30.734
for possible indictments.

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:32.467
-Breaking news --
the House now voting,

00:00:32.467 --> 00:00:34.901
moments ago here,
just in the last few minutes,

00:00:34.901 --> 00:00:38.167
to formally hold the two men
you see on your screen --

00:00:38.167 --> 00:00:41.334
Trump aides Peter Navarro
and Dan Scavino --

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.934
in criminal contempt
of Congress.

00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:45.634
This is what Democrats
had projected.

00:00:45.634 --> 00:00:47.467
They did hold together
in the final vote.

00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:51.767
You see here 220 in favor
of contempt, 203 against.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:54.801
And that updates to, now,
four former Trump aides

00:00:54.801 --> 00:00:56.434
who served
in the White House here

00:00:56.434 --> 00:01:00.100
or were otherwise former
White House officials

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.033
at the time of the insurrection,
in the case of Bannon.

00:01:02.033 --> 00:01:03.868
These four have all been
now held in contempt

00:01:03.868 --> 00:01:04.767
by the full Congress.

00:01:04.767 --> 00:01:07.367
One of them has been indicted.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.367
Steve Bannon is the only one
to face that indictment.

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:11.801
-Now, Bannon is the only one

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:13.167
who's actually been indicted,
so far,

00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:15.267
but he is out awaiting trial,
which is weird

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:17.067
because he already has
the complexion of a guy

00:01:17.067 --> 00:01:19.200
who's gotten a little
too much sun in the prison yard.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.734
[ Laughter ]
It's also funny

00:01:20.734 --> 00:01:22.267
that he got busted
for coup stuff,

00:01:22.267 --> 00:01:24.200
when he looks more like a dude
who got busted

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:26.000
for illegally selling reptiles

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.934
[ Laughter and applause ]
on the Venice Beach boardwalk.

00:01:27.934 --> 00:01:29.400
[ As Bannon ]
What are you looking for,
a cobra, a black mamba?

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.801
I just got a Komodo dragon

00:01:30.801 --> 00:01:32.634
[ Laughter ]
smuggled in from my guy
in Jakarta.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.634
So that's four,
four Trump associates

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:35.868
who've been held
in contempt, now,

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:38.100
along with all the other
former Trump cronies

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:40.133
who went to jail, you know,
for other crimes.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:41.767
At this point,
it's easier to list

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:43.801
the Trump aides who aren't
in legal trouble.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:45.968
Honestly, now that
I think of it, I'm stumped.

00:01:45.968 --> 00:01:48.234
I mean, Trump's
under multiple investigation.

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:49.968
Michael Cohen already went
to jail.

00:01:49.968 --> 00:01:51.801
Rudy's being sued
for like a billion dollars.

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:54.267
[ Laughter ]
I mean, Scaramucci?

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:55.267
I mean, last I checked,

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:56.601
Scaramucci's in the clear,
right?

00:01:56.601 --> 00:01:58.334
I mean, I guess
that's the advantage

00:01:58.334 --> 00:02:00.234
of only being there for 11 days.

00:02:00.234 --> 00:02:01.501
[ Laughter ]
It's hard hard to get

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:03.501
in too much trouble
during orientation.

00:02:03.501 --> 00:02:04.801
[ Laughter ]

00:02:04.801 --> 00:02:07.167
"Okay, your desk is here.
The kitchen is there.

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:09.367
And do you want to bring down
the government with us?

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:12.167
[ Laughter ]
You do? Great. Hold on.
That's the president calling.

00:02:12.167 --> 00:02:14.501
Uh-huh, yes.
I'm with him right now.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:17.167
Okay. Okay.

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.701
Alright, I'll tell him.

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:19.834
I'm sorry. You're fired."

00:02:19.834 --> 00:02:21.667
[ Laughter ]
Now,

00:02:21.667 --> 00:02:23.167
do we all remember the Mooch?

00:02:23.167 --> 00:02:25.701
I mean, by golly, I reckon
that was nigh half a score ago.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:28.968
Oh, how things have changed
post the Mooch!

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:32.100
[ Laughter ]
Back then, I was
a fresh-faced talk show host

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:33.234
with a suit budget.

00:02:33.234 --> 00:02:36.267
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.267 --> 00:02:39.434
And now I'm so grizzled,
Netflix just cast Al Pacino

00:02:39.434 --> 00:02:42.033
to play me in the film
dramatization of "Ya Burnt."

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.701
[ Laughter ]
[ As Pacino ] I'm burnt?

00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:44.634
You're burnt!

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:46.467
This whole audience is burnt!

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:48.601
[ Laughter ]
Anyway, the contempt vote

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:50.133
was not, of course,
without drama.

00:02:50.133 --> 00:02:51.534
Congresswoman
Marjorie Taylor Greene,

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:55.400
aka the Are You for [Bleep] Real
Housewife of D.C.,

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.300
[ Laughter ]
heckled Congressman Jamie Raskin

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.200
as he was speaking,

00:02:58.200 --> 00:02:59.801
like a drunk aunt
at a comedy show

00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:01.434
who thinks everyone's there
to see her.

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:04.067
And then, later,
House GOP Leader Kevin McCarthy

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.901
threw a fit when he noticed
some Democrats

00:03:05.901 --> 00:03:08.367
standing and talking
during his floor speech.

00:03:08.367 --> 00:03:10.234
-I was going to tell
Mr. Speaker,

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:12.601
if the House is not in order

00:03:12.601 --> 00:03:14.667
and you need to listen
to the staff, I can pause.

00:03:18.767 --> 00:03:20.934
-Are you yielding?

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:24.567
-No. I said to Mr. Speaker,
the House is not in order.

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:25.801
There was no yielding.

00:03:25.801 --> 00:03:28.100
Your staff is committing
to communicate.

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.467
I think, if I'm speaking,
the House should be in order.

00:03:30.467 --> 00:03:32.367
I don't know if that's
a criminal offense, too.

00:03:32.367 --> 00:03:34.200
-You've not been heckled
by any of our members.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:36.634
-Mr. Speaker, I have the time.
-The gentleman from California

00:03:36.634 --> 00:03:37.601
-I wish you would have
-is recognized

00:03:37.601 --> 00:03:38.801
-the gavel.

00:03:38.801 --> 00:03:39.834
-The gentleman from --
-The speaker of the House

00:03:39.834 --> 00:03:41.000
is not in order.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.834
Mr. Speaker,
for the House to be in order,

00:03:42.834 --> 00:03:45.501
should people be in their seats
or should be people talking?

00:03:45.501 --> 00:03:47.601
[ Laughter ]

00:03:47.601 --> 00:03:49.000
-Proceed.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:50.734
-Mr. Speaker,
the House is not in order.

00:03:50.734 --> 00:03:52.334
People are standing
and talking.

00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:54.133
-Buddy, if people are standing
and talking,

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.400
you can't bitch about it.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.100
You got to grow a spine
and plow right through.

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:58.734
I mean, I would never get
through the monologue

00:03:58.734 --> 00:04:01.033
if I stopped every time
somebody got up and walked out.

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:02.634
"I will not sit here
and listen

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:04.434
to Spirit Airlines be insulted!"

00:04:04.434 --> 00:04:05.834
[ Laughter ]

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.601
Also, now, you have a problem
with standing and talking?

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:10.334
Two of your members
literally stood up

00:04:10.334 --> 00:04:13.100
and yelled at the president
during the State of the Union,

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.367
like drunk Mets fans

00:04:14.367 --> 00:04:16.601
who just found out
that deGrom's out for a month.

00:04:16.601 --> 00:04:18.467
[ Laughter ]
Sorry, 'Late Night' crew.

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.534
It's Opening Day
and the Mets jokes are back.

00:04:20.534 --> 00:04:22.367
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:22.367 --> 00:04:24.434
With a torn labrum, no less.

00:04:24.434 --> 00:04:25.734
[ Laughter ]
As you may have noticed,

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:27.367
McCarthy has a lot
in common with Trump,

00:04:27.367 --> 00:04:28.767
in at least one
particularly sense --

00:04:28.767 --> 00:04:31.601
Trump is both dangerous
and pathetic, at the same time,

00:04:31.601 --> 00:04:33.834
which is true of so much
of the GOP, these days.

00:04:33.834 --> 00:04:34.934
It's honestly bewildering.

00:04:34.934 --> 00:04:36.200
Trump's like one of those cats

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:37.801
that gets stuck on a Roomba,

00:04:37.801 --> 00:04:39.467
[ Laughter ]
but then, if you go near it,

00:04:39.467 --> 00:04:41.067
he'll hiss
and claw your eyes out.

00:04:41.067 --> 00:04:41.968
I mean, look at him.

00:04:41.968 --> 00:04:43.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:44.834
He looks like he should be
under a car

00:04:44.834 --> 00:04:47.434
while an animal control officer
tries to lure him out.

00:04:47.434 --> 00:04:48.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:48.434 --> 00:04:49.667
"Yeah, no, in the winter,

00:04:49.667 --> 00:04:51.801
like to cuddle up
under the engine for warmth.

00:04:51.801 --> 00:04:53.901
Come on out, you varmint!"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.901 --> 00:04:55.834
You know, we do need
whatever animal control

00:04:55.834 --> 00:04:57.701
for former presidents is
right now

00:04:57.701 --> 00:04:59.067
because no one seems
to be doing anything

00:04:59.067 --> 00:05:00.767
about the fact
that a former president

00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:03.167
who incited a violent mob
to attack the Capitol

00:05:03.167 --> 00:05:06.200
is still actively engaged
in a slow-moving coup,

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:08.000
intent on dismantling democracy.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:08.868
It feels crazy.

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:09.968
He's just out there,

00:05:09.968 --> 00:05:12.033
shanking drives
and haunting weddings.

00:05:12.033 --> 00:05:14.334
[ Laughter ]
It's like if,
instead of a shack in the woods,

00:05:14.334 --> 00:05:16.868
the Unabomber had a residency
at Caesar's Palace.

00:05:16.868 --> 00:05:18.501
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.501 --> 00:05:19.901
And he's still walking around,

00:05:19.901 --> 00:05:21.834
repeating the lie
that the election was stolen.

00:05:21.834 --> 00:05:24.067
And that's where
dangerous meets pathetic.

00:05:24.067 --> 00:05:26.033
For example,
in a recent interview,

00:05:26.033 --> 00:05:27.968
Trump challenged any Democrat

00:05:27.968 --> 00:05:29.901
to debate him
on his election bull[bleep].

00:05:29.901 --> 00:05:32.133
-Remember I offered
to debate anybody

00:05:32.133 --> 00:05:34.334
-Yeah.
-on the election?

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:35.634
You know,
I didn't have one person --

00:05:35.634 --> 00:05:36.801
-No one took you up, huh?

00:05:36.801 --> 00:05:39.067
-And we'd get big, big ratings.
-Yeah.

00:05:39.067 --> 00:05:40.901
-I offered to debate

00:05:40.901 --> 00:05:46.501
any Democrat politician
on the election of 2020

00:05:46.501 --> 00:05:48.167
and they didn't
because they can't defend it.

00:05:48.167 --> 00:05:50.601
-Yeah, sure, that's why
they don't want to debate you.

00:05:50.601 --> 00:05:52.634
You're like the high school nerd
who said,

00:05:52.634 --> 00:05:54.334
"I asked the head cheerleader
to prom,

00:05:54.334 --> 00:05:56.400
but she refused to go
because she can't keep up

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.200
with my scorching dance moves.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.334
Thank you,
Arthur Murray Dance Studio."

00:06:01.334 --> 00:06:02.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.934 --> 00:06:04.601
I want to make it clear
I was that kid.

00:06:04.601 --> 00:06:06.968
When other kids passed notes
in class that said...

00:06:07.801 --> 00:06:08.968
I passed notes that said...

00:06:10.601 --> 00:06:12.234
[ Laughter ]
And, by the way,

00:06:12.234 --> 00:06:14.234
the answer is absolutely yes

00:06:14.234 --> 00:06:16.100
because, if you know anything
about comic books,

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.634
you know it's official canon
that Batman devised a plan

00:06:18.634 --> 00:06:20.634
for how to incapacitate every
member of the Justice League,

00:06:20.634 --> 00:06:22.033
just in case any
of them went rogue.

00:06:22.033 --> 00:06:23.934
But then his plans fell
into the hands of Ra's al Ghul,

00:06:23.934 --> 00:06:25.000
who hacked Batman's
computer files,

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.734
and then Justice League
got super pissed

00:06:26.734 --> 00:06:27.834
and they almost kicked him out.

00:06:27.834 --> 00:06:29.934
[ Laughter ]

00:06:29.934 --> 00:06:31.667
I'm so winded
from that explanation,

00:06:31.667 --> 00:06:32.667
I need to use my inhaler.

00:06:32.667 --> 00:06:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.267 --> 00:06:39.300
And that was today's edition
of "A Closer Dork."

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.934
♪♪

00:06:40.934 --> 00:06:42.000
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:42.767
Where were we?

00:06:42.767 --> 00:06:44.501
Ah, yes, the insurrection.

00:06:44.501 --> 00:06:47.000
So, Trump says he challenged
Democrats to debate him

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.467
and no one took him up on it.

00:06:48.467 --> 00:06:49.934
As we said, it's pathetic
and, plus,

00:06:49.934 --> 00:06:51.267
no one's going
to debate you again

00:06:51.267 --> 00:06:53.367
after watching you
in an actual debate.

00:06:53.367 --> 00:06:55.601
Remember that first one
with Biden,

00:06:55.601 --> 00:06:57.667
where he couldn't stop
yelling out random nonsense,

00:06:57.667 --> 00:06:59.901
like a nursing home grandpa
watching "Card Sharks"

00:06:59.901 --> 00:07:01.567
[ Laughter ]
and the moderator,
Chris Wallace,

00:07:01.567 --> 00:07:02.767
had to keep yelling "No" at him

00:07:02.767 --> 00:07:04.701
like he was a dog
humping a neighbor's leg?

00:07:04.701 --> 00:07:06.534
[ Laughter ]
-I'll ask Joe.

00:07:06.534 --> 00:07:07.200
-No.
-The individual --

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.601
-No! Hey, Mr. President.

00:07:08.601 --> 00:07:10.300
-Which was heavily --
-No. Mr. President.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:12.634
No, no. Go ahead.
No, no, no. Mr. President.

00:07:12.634 --> 00:07:14.300
-$3.5 million, Joe.
-Mr. President.

00:07:14.300 --> 00:07:15.367
-$3.5 million.
-No, no, no, no.

00:07:15.367 --> 00:07:16.267
Mr. President.
-Go ahead.

00:07:16.267 --> 00:07:17.567
-No!
-Can I be honest?

00:07:17.567 --> 00:07:18.701
It's a very important question.
-Try to be honest.

00:07:18.701 --> 00:07:19.767
That'd be a good thing.
-He stood up.

00:07:19.767 --> 00:07:21.300
-No.
-He stood up
-The answer

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:22.767
-and he threatened --
-to the question is no.

00:07:22.767 --> 00:07:24.701
[ Laughter ]
-If Trump runs again in 2024,

00:07:24.701 --> 00:07:26.334
the Commission
on Presidential Debates

00:07:26.334 --> 00:07:28.033
is going to have to give him
a shock collar

00:07:28.033 --> 00:07:29.334
or, at the very least,

00:07:29.334 --> 00:07:30.968
shoot him
with a tranquilizer dart

00:07:30.968 --> 00:07:33.400
[ Laughter ]
whenever it's someone else's
turn to speak.

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.167
Of course, that would
only slow him down enough

00:07:35.167 --> 00:07:36.534
to make his voice normal.

00:07:36.534 --> 00:07:37.834
[ Transatlantic accent ]
Folks, we love the debates,

00:07:37.834 --> 00:07:38.634
don't we, folks?

00:07:38.634 --> 00:07:39.667
They are very entertaining.

00:07:39.667 --> 00:07:41.167
I will tell you that.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:41.167 --> 00:07:42.667
The House committee
investigating the coup

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:43.868
keeps holding people
in contempt,

00:07:43.868 --> 00:07:45.467
but we need more
accountability than that.

00:07:45.467 --> 00:07:48.234
Donald Trump incited a violent
mob to overthrow democracy

00:07:48.234 --> 00:07:49.567
and now, he's doing it all
over again

00:07:49.567 --> 00:07:52.300
by undermining our elections
in advance of 2024.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.801
He shouldn't be golfing
like a free man.

00:07:53.801 --> 00:07:55.100
He should be in a courtroom,

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.400
asking to get out on bail
and having a judge tell him

00:07:57.400 --> 00:07:59.300
-The answer to the
question is no.

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:01.234
[ Laughter ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:01.234 --> 00:08:05.033
♪♪

00:08:05.033 --> 00:08:06.434
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:08:06.434 --> 00:08:07.734
over two million meals a year

00:08:07.734 --> 00:08:09.634
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:08:09.634 --> 00:08:11.234
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:08:11.234 --> 00:08:13.033
and they need your help,
now, more than ever.

00:08:13.033 --> 00:08:15.033
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the Donate button.

00:08:15.033 --> 00:08:17.968
Stay safe. Get vaccinated.
We love you.

